                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9d1c4313-aaa3-3dd0-bd39-10d1658d9ce1",
                        "entry_id": "2eeaf5b8-a7b9-3278-99aa-fabda164dbc2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The state of being homeless."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c51d0445-10dc-4011-8a37-6c0ad191b917",
                                "sense_id": "9d1c4313-aaa3-3dd0-bd39-10d1658d9ce1",
                                "text": "Houseless and Homeless. The estimate of the New York Housing Conference Secretary, Mr. Edward P. Doyle, that it will take half a billion dollars to overcome the present housing shortage, is probably not an exaggerated presentation of the plight New York is in in this respect. Furthermore, the housing-shortage conditions of New York reflect, proportionately, the conditions prevalent in almost every large city in the country. We seem to be threatened with widespread houselessness and homelessness, for the pitiable makeshifts to which so many are driven by house shortage, and the consequent exorbitant rents, are appalling travesties of what American homes should be. Just what Mr. Walter Stabler, Comptroller of the Metropolitan Life Insurance Company, meant when he said that \"unless radical action is taken something drastic will happen,\" is not quite clear. \"Something drastic\" is a pretty vague term. Mr. Stabler could hardly mean riotous invasions of the premises of the \"ins\" by infuriated mobs of the \"outs.\" Houselessness is undoubtedly a breeder of lawlessness, but it is not open to direct-action remedies of the bread riot variety which sheer hunger not infrequently precipitates. If people have not a place to lay their heads at night, not because they are penniless but because there are no roofs to shelter them, about the only thing they can do is to camp in parks and suburban fields. It has even come to that in Newark, and it may come to that elsewhere unless there is relief of some sort."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8687afe-848d-4034-a810-72260ee08bfb",
                                "sense_id": "9d1c4313-aaa3-3dd0-bd39-10d1658d9ce1",
                                "text": "The devastating effect of the violence is illustrated by the unprecedented humanitarian catastrophe of the 1994 Rwandan genocide that caused deaths, homelessness, despair, poverty, political instability, and economic stagnation in this country."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cfcf916e-0c94-45ef-9e9b-59d73e4aacd3",
                        "source_entry_id": "2eeaf5b8-a7b9-3278-99aa-fabda164dbc2",
                        "source_sense_id": "9d1c4313-aaa3-3dd0-bd39-10d1658d9ce1",
                        "source_sense_description": "state of being homeless",
                        "target_lang_word": "itinérance",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "itinérance",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44861875-42aa-3ab0-8c52-402e99563487",
                                        "entry_id": "30cce38c-6a8e-3592-a384-585807e71c5f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Déplacement, fait de se déplacer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "literary"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1d4f6db-88fa-4995-9d6e-e613b2b8e155",
                                                "sense_id": "44861875-42aa-3ab0-8c52-402e99563487",
                                                "text": "Ce geste en fait ici-bas un perpétuel pèlerin, et le cloître n’est que l’expression de cette itinérance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "265b5306-73bf-3ffe-8db8-7fdfce022a91",
                                        "entry_id": "30cce38c-6a8e-3592-a384-585807e71c5f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fait d’être à la rue, d’être sans domicile."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Québec"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ccbf0c5d-da5d-40fa-a3fc-1ab2d5d2fcf4",
                                                "sense_id": "265b5306-73bf-3ffe-8db8-7fdfce022a91",
                                                "text": "Care Failure […] a connu une enfance difficile qui l’a très tôt menée à la dépendance à la drogue et à l’itinérance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ceb718a-1bd7-4295-bce0-3047446e618b",
                                                "sense_id": "265b5306-73bf-3ffe-8db8-7fdfce022a91",
                                                "text": "tu pourrais jeter les sacs à l’intersection\ndes rues Pollus Potter et van Baerle\nlà où l’itinérance s’est retirée pour laisser place\naux mouvements altiers"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f41a1b2d-8d62-4171-b3bf-45b031115f91",
                                                "sense_id": "265b5306-73bf-3ffe-8db8-7fdfce022a91",
                                                "text": "Valérie Plante, mairesse de Montréal, a réagi en lançant la balle ailleurs : « L’itinérance, c’est provincial et le CIUSSS est en charge ». Pauvres de pauvres, pas de chance là non plus. L’itinérance, c’est la pointe de l’iceberg de la pauvreté."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4f8da52-d9db-392c-bce1-f300da465192",
                                        "entry_id": "30cce38c-6a8e-3592-a384-585807e71c5f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Capacité d’un téléphone portable à être employé hors de sa zone de service originelle, généralement source de frais supplémentaires."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f2674af-8bd3-4216-a535-a20d9f5494f7",
                                                "sense_id": "a4f8da52-d9db-392c-bce1-f300da465192",
                                                "text": "Bannis à partir du 15 juin 2017, ces frais d’itinérance sont tous les frais supplémentaires facturés pour les appels, l’envoi de SMS ou l’utilisation de l’Internet mobile à l’étranger au sein de l’UE."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0a82c40-b448-421b-a403-c009e3b24911",
                                                "sense_id": "a4f8da52-d9db-392c-bce1-f300da465192",
                                                "text": "Et comme un malheur n’arrive jamais seul, [Belgacom] a pâti de la limitation par la Commission européenne […] des tarifs de l’itinérance facturés aux clients lorsqu’ils utilisent leur téléphone portable depuis l'étranger (« roaming »)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f19c1933-9037-4d26-91e2-0b905d141f69",
                                                "sense_id": "a4f8da52-d9db-392c-bce1-f300da465192",
                                                "text": "[L]es opérateurs établis comme Rogers ne seront pas tenus d’offrir gratuitement les services d’itinérance (roaming) aux abonnés des nouveaux joueurs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7e0033ed-fb0b-4b13-aef8-2d18e8a2fe56",
